{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44475","headline":"诗三百三首 一七二 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 一七二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自闻梁朝日，四依诸贤士。\n宝志万回师，四仙傅大士。\n显扬一代教，作时如来使。\n造建僧伽蓝，信心归佛理。\n虽乃得如斯，有爲多患累。\n与道殊悬远，折西补东尔。\n不达无爲功，损多益少利。\n有声而无形，至今何处去。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44475.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44475","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}